Now why is this important?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.480
Well there's so many benefits to creating goals.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:22.680
Things like helping your team have more focus and unity.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.840
So we all know we're on the same page, we all know what we're doing, we're all unified

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.600
in our energy and our efforts and that feels really satisfying when we do that.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:38.080
You also have things like tracking how you're going and evaluating or measuring your progress.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:42.160
Now anything at all that's important, we want to measure it, we want to track it.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:47.160
You and I would not jump on an airplane if the captain could not track the important

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:52.600
metrics or measurements connected to the safety of that flight.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.000
Because anything at all that's important, you want to measure, you want to track it

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.320
and evaluate it.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:03.640
Now your time, my time, our time and the things that we care about are important.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:08.040
Therefore we want to track them and we want to evaluate them because it helps us in terms

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.040
of feedback.

