So when it comes to the ESIP model, so most of you watching this, you should be familiar

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:24.400
with this model and the ESIP model allows us to diagnose in more detail and helps us

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:30.480
grow as people and grow as a team how we're doing in terms of culture, in terms of our

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.520
beliefs, our purpose, are we clear on our goals, our values, maybe we don't have the

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.440
right structures in place and we need help with that, maybe we need great mentoring which

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.360
is in the people component and we need some support in that.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:49.240
So when it comes to our top five weekly goals, when we track and evaluate how we're doing,

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:55.040
the people who are supporting you can help you because they can evaluate more effectively

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:59.320
and then work with the ESIP model to support you even further.

