So if you're not a team leader, your team leader really depends on you to support them

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:13.400
in helping the system work and for you to be accountable for it to being working.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.840
Without accountability, now we all just go off in different directions and it's chaos

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.840
and we don't want that.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.520
We want to feel unified, we want to feel together so that we can achieve some amazing things

